    <title>Corporate Governance | Macquarie Group</title>
    
    <meta name="description" content="Macquarie’s approach to corporate governance is to identify opportunity, promote the long term profitability while managing risk, drive superior and sustainable shareholder value and meet stakeholder expectations of sound corporate governance."/>
