<div id="text-f922326795" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="board"></a>Board of Directors</h3>
<p>Macquarie recognises that independent directors have an important role in assuring shareholders that the Board is able to act in the best interests of Macquarie and independently of management. The Policy on Board Renewal, Appointment of Directors and Board Performance Review sets out the fundamental factors relevant to the selection and appointment of new Directors.</p>

