<div id="text-ca32b74a37" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="business-conduct"></a>Business conduct and ethics</h3>
<p>Macquarie’s Code of Conduct sets out the way staff are expected to do business. The Code of Conduct is also reflected in, and supported by, a broad range of Macquarie’s policies and procedures. </p>

</div>

    


