    <div class="text aem-GridColumn--offset--medium--0 aem-GridColumn--small--none aem-GridColumn--medium--none aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn--medium--12 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--small--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--small--0 aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-78df1fd76d" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="continuous-disclosure"></a>Continuous disclosure</h3>
<p>Macquarie believes that shareholders, regulators, ratings agencies and the investment community should be informed of all major business events and risks that influence Macquarie in a factual, timely and widely available manner. Macquarie’s continuous disclosure policy is incorporated in the Continuous Disclosure Policy.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
